1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:38,040
Jinxia Pass is a vital strategic point.

3
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,320
If we lose it,

4
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,320
Beijian's iron cavalry
can sweep straight in.

5
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:43,640
As long as we stand, the pass stands.

6
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,000
We cannot lose it.

7
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,160
Report!

8
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,840
Urgent report!

9
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,480
Beijian's army has attacked Jinxia Pass.

10
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,600
Beijian truly has wolfish ambitions.

11
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,880
They changed their main
attack at the last second.

12
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:58,480
General Di,

13
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,840
we have only a handful of
troops left at Jinxia Pass.

14
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:02,640
His Majesty is camped a hundred li away.

15
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:04,400
Light the beacon.

16
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,920
Within two hours at the latest,

17
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,040
reinforcements will arrive.

18
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:09,000
We are badly outnumbered by Beijian.

19
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,800
I fear we cannot hold for two hours.

20
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,880
They outnumber us.

21
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,360
Our only defense is to attack.

22
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:15,760
Pass my order.

23
00:02:16,480 --> 00:02:17,440
Light the beacon fires.

24
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,680
Follow me into battle.

25
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,400
Yes.

26
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:30,120
The beacon is lit. Something's
wrong at Jinxia Pass.

27
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,640
-Saddle the horses.
-Yes.

28
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:58,480
Today,

29
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,880
we will break through Jinxia Pass.

30
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,800
Not a chance.

31
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:06,320
-Kill!
-Kill!

32
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,680
Huo An!

33
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,440
Zhili.

34
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,960
Happy birthday.

35
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,080
You're another year older.

36
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,880
And now I'm taller than you.

37
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:36,400
From now on, I can always protect you.

38
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,160
And one more thing.

39
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,320
Stop calling me little brother.

40
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,840
All right?

41
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,840
Zhili.

42
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,320
Happy birthday.

43
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,200
You asked me what I wished for.

44
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,240
I wanted to say...

45
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,400
Ever since I entered the Shen household,

46
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,080
my wish has never changed.

47
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,360
I want to tell you

48
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,280
that I like you.

49
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,680
I truly do.

50
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:08,240
Anian.

51
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,320
Wait for me.

52
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:15,040
I have so much I want to tell you.

53
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:50,960
I found this while searching
a valley outside the capital.

54
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,600
They say carrying it

55
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,200
brings good luck.

56
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,680
You need the luck more than I do.

57
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,080
Zhili.

58
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,200
Will you marry me?

59
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,560
About my past...

60
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,480
you truly don't care?

61
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:04,960
I don't.

62
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:08,400
But do you know the knot in my heart

63
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,800
cannot be undone by saying you don't care?

64
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,960
Zhili,

65
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:19,080
do you like me even a little now?

66
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:31,880
You said

67
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:35,040
this peachwood brings good luck.

68
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,400
It can keep people safe.

69
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,360
I want you to come back safely.

70
00:06:48,520 --> 00:06:49,440
Anian.

71
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,320
Soldiers of Daning!

72
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:12,880
Not one step back!

73
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,320
Anian!

74
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,240
-Anian!
-Anian!

75
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,680
Anian!

76
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,600
Your Majesty.

77
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:50,760
I...

78
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:53,600
have fulfilled my mission.

79
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:12,360
All soldiers, hear my command!

80
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,960
Slaughter every Beijian dog!

81
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:20,360
Send them to the grave
with our fallen men!

82
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,920
Report! A great victory!

83
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,240
Di Nian and Beijian's First Prince

84
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,520
both died at Jinxia Pass.

85
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:45,320
At last, the day has come.

86
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,640
He's dead.

87
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:50,040
Good.

88
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,120
Anian.

89
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:56,960
Anian.

90
00:08:58,800 --> 00:08:59,880
Princess.

91
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:02,160
I kept my promise to you.

92
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,520
Zhongwan lost not a single soldier,

93
00:09:05,400 --> 00:09:07,040
yet took the realm with ease.

94
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:11,240
Yin Qing.

95
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:17,480
You worked beside Anian for three years.

96
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,400
How can you still smile?

97
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,000
Have you even thought about

98
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,680
what Zhili must be feeling right now?

99
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,680
I've told you.

100
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:31,080
I am Shangguan Zhao,

101
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:33,440
not Yin Qing.

102
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:40,720
Fine.

103
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,680
Then let all of this

104
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,320
end as soon as possible.

105
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,240
Madam, a letter from Qingzhou.

106
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,640
Anian.

107
00:10:39,520 --> 00:10:40,680
Anian.

108
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,800
Anian.

109
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:25,120
Beijian's First Prince's head.

110
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,520
I've brought it to you.

111
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,960
Thank you, Daning, for
ridding me of Beijian royalty.

112
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:33,400
Today, by order of Zhongwan's
Empress Murong Yao,

113
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,400
I've come for your head.

114
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,720
Shangguan Zhao.

115
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,120
If I could once give you a way to live,

116
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:41,200
I can also send you to your death.

117
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:42,280
Shangguan Zhao.

118
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,080
Anian's blood debt

119
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:45,560
must be repaid in blood.

120
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,320
All soldiers, hear my command!

121
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:58,680
Stop!

122
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,040
I, Murong Yao,

123
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:25,360
as the last blood of
Zhongwan's royal house,

124
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,440
command every soldier of Zhongwan

125
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:29,080
to lay down your weapons.

126
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,560
Princess, you cannot!

127
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,240
Yin Qing.

128
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,440
Your obsession is restoring the kingdom.

129
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,960
Mine

130
00:12:43,280 --> 00:12:45,320
is giving Zhongwan's people peaceful lives

131
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,320
so they never have to
wander homeless again.

132
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:49,280
Soldiers of Zhongwan,

133
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:51,080
if war begins today,

134
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,720
Zhongwan will bear the first blow.

135
00:12:53,280 --> 00:12:55,440
Every neighboring state will
seize the chance to fight.

136
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:58,520
Do you truly want to restore Zhongwan,

137
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,800
or destroy the entire realm?

138
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:10,760
Ying Gua.

139
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:13,480
Your father killed my father and mother

140
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,240
and destroyed my homeland.

141
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,680
I should hate you to the bone.

142
00:13:17,760 --> 00:13:18,960
And yet, in the end,

143
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:21,400
I cannot even bring myself to resent you.

144
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,160
Because I know

145
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,560
you also cannot bear to
see the people suffer.

146
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,720
In your own way,

147
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:31,920
you are trying to end the
hatred between our nations.

148
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,640
Can there ever be a
clean slate between us?

149
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:44,400
You cannot even bring yourself to stab me.

150
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:47,000
How am I supposed to believe you?

151
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,200
I know how hard this has been for you.

152
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,560
But rest assured.

153
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:55,760
Whatever choice you make,

154
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,400
I will stand by you.

155
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,600
Beijian raids Xigu Pass in three days.

156
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,560
Their arrows will be poisoned.

157
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,720
One scratch

158
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,480
will be fatal.

159
00:14:15,560 --> 00:14:17,280
I never doubted you.

160
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,280
In Daning's household registers,

161
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,360
there will no longer
be Daning and Zhongwan.

162
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:22,320
This realm

163
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,600
belongs to all its people.

164
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,800
Here is the new Zhongwan policy.

165
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:34,120
Hereditary slave status is abolished.

166
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,160
From this day forward,

167
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,320
they will be freed from slavery,

168
00:14:37,400 --> 00:14:38,400
given farmland,

169
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:40,240
and allowed to serve
in office or the army.

170
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,640
This is Zhongwan's
people's true way forward.

171
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:44,920
Sir.

172
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,960
The survivors have been pardoned.

173
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:49,160
From now on, there is
no Zhongwan slave camp.

174
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:51,920
Princess.

175
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,760
Daning is deceitful. It cannot be trusted.

176
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,240
When Daning's iron cavalry

177
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,680
stormed Zhongwan's royal capital,

178
00:14:56,760 --> 00:14:58,400
did they show us even a shred of mercy?

179
00:14:58,480 --> 00:14:59,800
From this day forward...

180
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:04,840
Your Majesty.

181
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:08,160
I swear upon my imperial blood:

182
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,320
in the household registers,

183
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,480
there shall be only people of Daning,

184
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:13,560
never Zhongwan or Daning apart.

185
00:15:14,400 --> 00:15:15,560
If I break this oath,

186
00:15:15,640 --> 00:15:17,200
may the mountains and rivers forsake me.

187
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,280
Meng Tinghui.

188
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,720
I promise you here and now:

189
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:21,720
all Zhongwan lands of old

190
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,400
shall be yours.

191
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,840
Zhongwan

192
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,280
shall stand as a realm within the realm.

193
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:28,360
Princess.

194
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:31,920
Ying Gua only wants a rightful
claim to you and Zhongwan.

195
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:34,440
What I offer you is the entire realm.

196
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:36,200
I will make you

197
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:37,520
the first woman Emperor in history.

198
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,200
Ying Gua.

199
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,080
The lands Zhongwan lost,

200
00:15:44,160 --> 00:15:45,480
I will reclaim by the sword.

201
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:47,040
I do not need your charity.

202
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,360
Soldiers of Zhongwan, hear my command!

203
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:51,040
Kill every Daning dog!

204
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,520
Reclaim our homeland!

205
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:04,720
Sir.

206
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:06,560
Stop clinging to this madness.

207
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:07,840
Yin Qing.

208
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:09,720
Give it up.

209
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,320
I have waited all these years

210
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,720
and plotted my entire life.

211
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:27,800
Even if I am the last
Zhongwan man alive today,

212
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,520
I will never give up.

213
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:50,840
Meng Tinghui.

214
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:00,320
Princess.

215
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,480
Since you want to return
to Daning so badly,

216
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,360
I'll grant your wish.

217
00:17:06,840 --> 00:17:07,880
-Shangguan Zhao!
-Princess!

218
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:15,400
Sir!

219
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:19,800
My lord.

220
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,720
You've already killed
Daning's greatest criminal.

221
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,600
Go back to Daning.

222
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,760
-Loose!
-No!

223
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,160
Sir!

224
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:07,960
Forget Shangguan Zhao.

225
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:14,960
Remember Yin Qing.

226
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:18,560
My lord.

227
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:25,360
I can see...

228
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,760
a rainbow.

229
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:35,480
Lord Meng.

230
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,160
Are you the one...?

231
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,760
I'm Yin Qing.

232
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,320
From all my years roaming the jianghu,

233
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,760
traveling across mountains and rivers,

234
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:46,080
and reading countless books,

235
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,960
I can tell it's because you two

236
00:18:51,040 --> 00:18:52,720
were born beautiful.

237
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:56,240
What office was I just promoted to again?

238
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:59,800
-Deputy Director Yin.
-Deputy Director Yin.

239
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:04,280
No matter how fierce the
storms of this world,

240
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:06,520
one day they will pass.

241
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,360
Yin Qing.

242
00:19:09,200 --> 00:19:10,040
Thank you.

243
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:11,680
My lord.

244
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:13,760
As long as Yin Qing lives,

245
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,400
I will keep you safe.

246
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:19,360
Brother Shangguan!

247
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:27,200
Brother Shangguan!

248
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:33,480
Brother Shangguan!

249
00:19:43,360 --> 00:19:45,080
Brother Shangguan!

250
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:00,520
Don't go!

251
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,760
Don't!

252
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,000
Sir.

253
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:20,040
I've come to join you.

254
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,120
Situ Xue.

255
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,440
Mengmeng.

256
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,040
Mengmeng, you're awake.

257
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:08,720
Are you hungry? Do you
want something to eat?

258
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:09,680
Some water?

259
00:22:13,120 --> 00:22:13,960
Here.

260
00:22:15,320 --> 00:22:16,360
You're finally back.

261
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:18,440
I thought I'd never see you again.

262
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:21,320
The war is over.

263
00:22:23,760 --> 00:22:25,880
Now we can finally be together in peace.

264
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:29,760
I still want to see you

265
00:22:29,840 --> 00:22:32,080
open Bofeng House all across the realm.

266
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:36,120
Daning's soldiers respect
and honor you now.

267
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:37,760
No one will ever question
who you are again.

268
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,680
Zhishu and I have made up too.

269
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:42,080
I think

270
00:22:42,160 --> 00:22:43,600
this is the best ending we could hope for.

271
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:45,720
Young Lord Shen is utterly devoted to you.

272
00:22:46,960 --> 00:22:48,960
Knowing you have such
a good man beside you,

273
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:51,080
puts my heart at ease.

274
00:22:52,040 --> 00:22:53,160
And what about you?

275
00:22:53,960 --> 00:22:55,440
You and His Majesty...

276
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,240
Fuzhi.

277
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,720
I don't know why,

278
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,680
but lately I keep thinking about

279
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:09,480
that old tree at Shazhou Women's Academy.

280
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:11,680
And I keep craving apricot-skin cakes.

281
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:13,320
Then I'll make some for you right now.

282
00:23:14,800 --> 00:23:15,640
What's wrong?

283
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:18,120
This is a military camp.

284
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,320
Where will you find ingredients?

285
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,480
If you want something,

286
00:23:20,560 --> 00:23:21,600
Even if I must pluck down stars,

287
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,680
I'll get it for you.

288
00:23:22,760 --> 00:23:23,600
Wait for me.

289
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:25,360
I will.

290
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:36,480
Look at this batch...

291
00:23:38,920 --> 00:23:40,120
Mengmeng?

292
00:24:06,320 --> 00:24:07,560
To His Majesty.

293
00:24:08,560 --> 00:24:10,000
The realm was your betrothal gift,

294
00:24:10,080 --> 00:24:11,400
as you promised.

295
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,600
To offer the rest of my life to this realm

296
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:16,120
is my duty as your subject

297
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:18,280
and the heart of the one who loves you.

298
00:24:20,320 --> 00:24:21,400
This game is over.

299
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:23,040
To withdraw when the work is done

300
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,440
is how neither of us fails the other.

301
00:24:27,040 --> 00:24:28,960
I worry only for Zhili and Fuzhi.

302
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:31,920
Zhili has lost Anian

303
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:33,600
and is broken with grief.

304
00:24:34,280 --> 00:24:36,000
Fuzhi burns as fiercely as fire

305
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,600
and can easily burn herself.

306
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:40,600
I ask you and Zhishu

307
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:42,840
to keep them safe and
peaceful all their lives.

308
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:44,720
This is

309
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:46,680
my final selfish request.

310
00:24:48,240 --> 00:24:50,000
I take my weariness with me

311
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:52,440
and leave behind endless clear skies.

312
00:24:52,520 --> 00:24:53,840
This is my way of setting us both free.

313
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:56,840
May you rule all beneath Heaven with care,

314
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:58,480
guard these mountains and rivers,

315
00:24:58,560 --> 00:25:00,080
and be remembered as a wise Emperor.

316
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,720
And may I always remain

317
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:04,440
the Meng Tinghui of the
Office of Public Inquiry,

318
00:25:04,520 --> 00:25:06,960
who debated statecraft
with you by lamplight.

319
00:25:08,360 --> 00:25:11,320
May every night you read memorials,

320
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:15,720
the candle beside your desk burn warm.

321
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:34,520
(Three years later)

322
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,520
Di An!

323
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:03,040
Di An!

324
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:10,280
Mother!

325
00:26:12,800 --> 00:26:13,960
Di An.

326
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:21,560
No fooling around before His Majesty.

327
00:26:26,400 --> 00:26:27,520
Mother.

328
00:26:27,600 --> 00:26:29,400
I'm better than Father.

329
00:26:30,760 --> 00:26:32,520
Then you must first train hard.

330
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:46,160
Mother,

331
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:47,920
why did you like Father?

332
00:26:56,240 --> 00:26:57,080
Zhili.

333
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:13,480
It wasn't just liking him.

334
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:16,240
I loved him.

335
00:27:17,520 --> 00:27:18,480
I only realized it too late.

336
00:27:21,800 --> 00:27:22,640
Di An!

337
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:26,840
Uncle!

338
00:27:36,040 --> 00:27:37,880
Good boy. I'll take you
to the training grounds

339
00:27:37,960 --> 00:27:39,480
where your father used to practice.

340
00:27:45,440 --> 00:27:47,760
Uncle, I'm going to be a great general.

341
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:50,720
I'll protect Mother

342
00:27:50,800 --> 00:27:51,920
and protect His Majesty.

343
00:28:02,440 --> 00:28:08,320
-Good.
-Good.

344
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,800
Good.

345
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:12,840
Manager Yan.

346
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,840
With His Majesty's
"Imperial Merchant" plaque,

347
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:15,760
we lead the capital

348
00:28:15,840 --> 00:28:17,600
among its seventy-two merchant houses.

349
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:20,080
This is only the beginning.

350
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,760
I want Bofeng House branches

351
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:22,800
all across Daning.

352
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:25,040
I'm heading to Xuzhou and Bianzhou

353
00:28:25,120 --> 00:28:26,080
to look at new locations.

354
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:28,040
I'll leave the capital's twelve branches

355
00:28:28,120 --> 00:28:29,240
in all your hands.

356
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,000
-Yes.
-Yes.

357
00:28:31,080 --> 00:28:32,080
Manager Yan!

358
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:33,800
Manager Yan!

359
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,120
Wonderful news!

360
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:37,440
Young Lord Shen has won
another great victory.

361
00:28:37,520 --> 00:28:39,080
He's about to be promoted and ennobled.

362
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,600
With such good fortune,

363
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:42,320
why are you still fussing
over new branches?

364
00:28:44,360 --> 00:28:46,040
Precisely because they're all high above,

365
00:28:46,600 --> 00:28:48,160
I need to lay the road on the ground

366
00:28:48,240 --> 00:28:49,600
even farther ahead.

367
00:28:51,320 --> 00:28:52,200
Let's go.

368
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:55,600
-Safe travels, Proprietor!
-Safe travels, Proprietor!

369
00:28:58,080 --> 00:28:59,320
Have a safe journey, Proprietor!

370
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:04,240
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

371
00:29:04,320 --> 00:29:05,280
Safe travels!

372
00:29:22,280 --> 00:29:24,840
With a wise ruler's grace above,

373
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:28,360
-With a wise ruler's grace above,
-With a wise ruler's grace above,

374
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:30,880
and worthy ministers serve below,

375
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:33,480
-and worthy ministers serve below,
-and worthy ministers serve below,

376
00:29:33,560 --> 00:29:35,320
only then can we govern the realm,

377
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:37,920
-only then can we govern the realm,
-only then can we govern the realm,

378
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:39,560
nurture the people,

379
00:29:39,640 --> 00:29:41,800
-nurture the people,
-nurture the people,

380
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,240
and secure lasting peace.

381
00:29:43,320 --> 00:29:45,320
-and secure lasting peace.
-and secure lasting peace.

382
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:47,760
If my life can serve the people,

383
00:29:48,320 --> 00:29:50,280
I shall not spare myself.

384
00:30:36,040 --> 00:30:38,880
You impersonated Situ Xue
and deceived the people.

385
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:41,200
You hid military weapons
and plotted rebellion.

386
00:30:41,280 --> 00:30:42,560
By law, you should be exiled.

387
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,160
What makes you think I'm an impostor?

388
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:53,600
You're selfish and self-serving,

389
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:54,920
and every word from you is a lie.

390
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:56,640
Once exposed, you twist your words,

391
00:30:56,720 --> 00:30:59,160
and play innocent and pitiful at will.

392
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:01,760
You're cunning, deceitful, and two-faced.

393
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:03,480
How do I know you're not lying to me?

394
00:31:06,400 --> 00:31:08,760
You certainly remember me well.

395
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:28,840
We meet again,

396
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:30,920
Miss Meng.

397
00:31:35,360 --> 00:31:36,760
With all your power,

398
00:31:37,360 --> 00:31:38,960
why not wipe out Black
Tiger Hall and Ding Chong?

399
00:31:39,040 --> 00:31:40,880
Why keep making life hard
for a helpless woman?

400
00:31:41,360 --> 00:31:42,520
What skill is there in that?

401
00:31:43,080 --> 00:31:44,160
You dared deceive me?

402
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:46,560
Then you're courting death.

403
00:31:47,240 --> 00:31:49,000
Since I brought you in,

404
00:31:49,080 --> 00:31:50,560
I won't let anything happen to you.

405
00:31:52,080 --> 00:31:53,680
A master like Young Master He

406
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,280
is afraid of a little snake?

407
00:32:00,840 --> 00:32:02,440
At least buy me a meal first.

408
00:32:13,560 --> 00:32:14,600
Miss Meng.

409
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:17,760
Until next time.

410
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:19,640
If fate allows,

411
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,720
we will meet again.

412
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:28,760
I think He Du of Shazhou

413
00:32:28,840 --> 00:32:30,280
was more interesting

414
00:32:31,040 --> 00:32:32,200
than the Emperor you are now.

415
00:32:35,600 --> 00:32:36,560
Young Master He.

416
00:32:36,640 --> 00:32:38,040
Warm broth in your stomach...

417
00:32:38,560 --> 00:32:40,200
Does the lamb broth taste good?

418
00:32:41,640 --> 00:32:42,600
It's good.

419
00:32:43,560 --> 00:32:44,760
Very good.

420
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:46,840
These lamb noodles taste
just like Shazhou's.

421
00:32:47,320 --> 00:32:49,240
Still spicy. Still fierce.

422
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,480
You truly

423
00:33:18,560 --> 00:33:21,280
made your way to stand
before me, step by step.

424
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:31,880
Young man.

425
00:33:34,040 --> 00:33:35,000
He Du.

426
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:36,760
Your Majesty.

427
00:33:38,360 --> 00:33:40,560
For ten years, under different identities,

428
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,760
you have witnessed my life.

429
00:33:45,400 --> 00:33:46,920
Why wait for snow to make a wish?

430
00:33:48,200 --> 00:33:50,240
I grant wishes better than Heaven.

431
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:55,960
I wish Daning peace and prosperity.

432
00:33:56,880 --> 00:33:59,120
And I hope next season,

433
00:34:00,160 --> 00:34:01,320
old friends are still beside me.

434
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:05,840
When spring comes,

435
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:08,320
shall we release river lanterns together?

436
00:34:08,400 --> 00:34:09,840
It's a promise.

437
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:17,760
Your Majesty.

438
00:35:31,240 --> 00:35:32,480
Meng Tinghui.

439
00:35:34,320 --> 00:35:35,400
Let's get married.

440
00:35:57,920 --> 00:35:58,800
It's been three years.

441
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:00,320
Daning has missed you.

442
00:36:01,720 --> 00:36:03,560
The storms at court are not over yet.

443
00:36:05,160 --> 00:36:06,920
Will you walk this road with me again?

444
00:36:08,644 --> 00:36:10,644

